.TH DANBY-STARMODEL 1
.SH NAME
danby-starmodel \- approximate hydrostatic stellar profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/starmodel
.SH MODEL
Hydrostatic pressure balance is integrated outward with enclosed-mass growth
and a polytropic equation of state. The graph shows normalized density and
enclosed mass versus radius.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/starmodel.b
